	(text "Main MCU 64 MiB QSPI NOR flash | Rev.A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1325404c-482f-413e-ac27-ddd328b98b37")
	)
	(text "MCU_FPGA_SCK, MOSI, MISO and CS_N form the buffered command link, with\nFPGA_IRQ as an event return. MCU_RESET_FPGA_N reaches PROGRAM_B through\nthe configuration-sheet open-drain buffer. FPGA_DONE_MCU and FPGA_INIT_N_MCU\nreach PC6/PC7 on the MCU supply sheet. Message formats and register maps\nmust be implemented in firmware and FPGA logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 102.239 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "373e75bd-4f6e-4b92-8337-2c0e5ce88084")
	)
	(text "J300 connects a four-bit SD interface: clock, command and MCU_SD_D0 through\nMCU_SD_D3. The 33 ohm resistors separate MCU nets from SD_*_CARD nets.\nThe 47 kohm resistors bias command and data. R323 pulls MCU_SD_CD_N high;\nthe card-detect switch returns this net to ground. It reaches U100 PG6 (pin 116).\nC302 and C303 provide 100 nF and 10 uF local supply capacitance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 62.306 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4248aaed-40fb-411d-977c-71964ab53b4e")
	)
	(text "Main MCU serial memory and control | Rev.A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "53c1993a-8355-46d2-80be-97e62a899757")
	)
	(text "Main MCU microSD connector"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "57786df7-afce-4bce-8f64-d63068d85ac6")
	)
	(text "MCU nonvolatile storage and board control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 14.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6653e0b0-a996-4ac5-8b4f-7e5c4a9f2e77")
	)
	(text "Main MCU serial memory and control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 25.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "71f2fab6-80bb-453a-b226-d07276237da3")
	)
	(text "Main MCU 64 MiB QSPI NOR flash"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 27.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c9b656f-bcba-4429-a8fe-6daaf17a16de")
	)
	(text "Main MCU microSD connector | Rev.A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8581a4e3-b189-432b-96e8-e7f909bb50df")
	)
	(text "HOST_ALIVE is an application heartbeat: falling edges every 50 ms,\nmaximum gap 100 ms. Stop pulses on lost link/session or task progress.\nPower sheet 5400 enforces a 170..230 ms timeout and first-edge readiness.\nHOST_WDI is separate MCU supervision. Neither heartbeat may use a free-\nrunning PWM/DMA. Status nets report the independent power manager."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 122.205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "88f29b5b-1a53-4508-99cd-83f8cab70720")
	)
	(text "U300 is a W25Q512JVEIQ NOR flash with 512 Mbit capacity, equivalent to 64\nMiB. MCU_QSPI_CLK, MCU_QSPI_CS_N and four data signals connect it to U100.\nR303 through R308 are 33 ohm series resistors. The 10 kohm pull-ups keep\nchip select and the IO2/IO3 multifunction pins defined during startup."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 42.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae6188e4-b431-425a-aa65-88aa76e96059")
	)
	(text "U301, U302 and U303 provide ESD paths for the six SD signal lines at the\nremovable-card interface. The card shell and return contacts connect to the\nindicated ground network."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 84.446 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae8c74c3-0f7f-4243-98e1-aa53c80f69ff")
	)
	(text "Main MCU microSD bias and ESD | Rev.A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 134.62 0)
